* Cardano smart contracts\ntwelve cards
** Objects
*** UTXO\n//created once, spent once, never edited//
*** Datum\n//datum = state, at most one per UTXO//
*** Redeemer\n//datum at lock time, redeemer at spend time//
*** Script context\n//the whole transaction, plus why the script runs//
** The contract
*** Validator\n//f(datum, redeemer, context) → yes or no//
*** Script address\n//address = hash of the code; funds locked by rules//
*** Minting policy\n//policy id = script hash; tokens live in UTXO values//
left side
** Operations
*** State transition\n//spend the old datum, create the new one, never edit//
*** Off-chain code\n//off-chain drafts, on-chain judges//
** The ledger
*** Deterministic validation\n//same transaction, same result, cost known in advance//
*** Two-phase validation\n//phase 1 fails for free; phase 2 failure costs collateral//
*** eUTXO model\n//coins with data, guarded by predicates, not accounts//
@endmindmap
